        "zeon": 100,
        "min_int": 10,
        "maintenance": 10,
        "resistance": null,
        "resistance_types": [],
        "description": "The caster knows if someone died within 500 feet of him less than an hour ago, or if there is someone in that radius who is likely to die in the next 10 minutes. This predictive ability does not allow him to know any specifics; he only senses the death."
